  <h2>2. What Zonesteward is</h2>
  <p>Zonesteward (the "Service") is software for managing Cloudflare zones. It reads analytics and configuration from Cloudflare using API tokens you provide, answers questions and produces charts and reports using a language model under an API key you provide, monitors zones against rules you set, and — only after a person in your workspace approves each specific change — makes changes to your Cloudflare configuration through Cloudflare's API.</p>
  <p>The Service is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by Cloudflare, Inc., Anthropic, PBC, OpenAI, or any other third party whose products it connects to. Their names are used only to describe what the Service works with.</p>

