  <h2>6. Changes to your Cloudflare configuration — and who is responsible</h2>
  <p>The Service is designed so that no change is made to Cloudflare without a person in your workspace approving that specific change, after being shown what it is, which zone it affects, and an estimate of its impact. Because of that design:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>You are solely responsible for every change approved in your workspace</strong>, by any member, and for its effect on your sites, your clients' sites, their visitors and their businesses.</li>
