    <li>"Revert" re-applies a recorded earlier state through the same approval process. It is offered as a convenience and may not fully restore prior behaviour, particularly where Cloudflare's own state, caches or propagation have moved on.</li>
    <li>You must review each proposed change before approving it, and you must not approve changes you do not understand or are not authorised to make.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Where the Service acts in ways you have configured in advance — for example a monitoring rule with automatic mitigation you have enabled — those actions are treated as approved by you at the time you enabled them.</p>

